OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for many,
OL,6,Fbecoming cloudier from the northeast
OL,7,Finto the afternoon yet still with
OL,8,Fplenty of sunny spells on offer.
OL,9,FTurning breezier along southern coasts
OL,10,Finto the afternoon. Feeling cooler
OL,11,Fthan yesterday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells allow
OL,14,Ftemperatures to drop off tonight, with
OL,15,Fsome mist and fog patches developing
OL,16,Fin prone locations. Remaining breezy
OL,17,Falong southern coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
