OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAgain, a bright start,
OL,6,Fleading into patchy clouds and long
OL,7,Fsunny spells through Tuesday. Brisk
OL,8,Fnortheasterly winds with stronger
OL,9,Fgusts along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FVariable cloud with sunny spells over
OL,13,Fthe next few days with light showers
OL,14,Fwhere the cloud thickens. Winds
OL,15,Fstrengthening through Wednesday, with
OL,16,Fstronger gusts along southern
OL,17,Fcoastlines.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
